This is a '''list of quotes by {{ai|Veto}}'''. Veto is voiced by Bamar Kane in English. Necessary quotes translated are from French or Wolof to English, unless otherwise stated. Veto has two versions of his quotes; his standard set, and Evolution set for when he is empowered by {{abi text|Evolution}} with the latter having a filter applied to them. The standard set contains {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Veto Standard Quotes}} files of quotes and the Evolution set contains {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Veto Evolution Quotes}} files of quotes, giving Veto a grand total of {{PAGESINCATEGORY:Veto Quotes}} files of quotes including unused and removed lines, and excluding [[#The Range's lore assets|The Range's lore assets]].

A downloadable folder containing all the audio files on this page can be found [https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1chVysy3fdHtURDE8Zk7UTqa9jWsjljaf?usp=sharing here]. For quotes during Evolution, including a few voice lines unique to it, see [[Veto/Quotes/Evolution]].

