*{{AC|file=VoicemailBrimstone117.mp3}} "Greetings, Brimstone. I just finalized my reports on the Paris incursion. Despite all the chaos [[Atlas]] created, we narrowly avoided exposing our operation. Although, [[Mary Adeyemi|Miss Adeyemi]] now knows more than she should. A consequence of me protecting her through that madness. I'm working with [[Cypher]] and [[Phoenix]] to minimize the issue, she seems to be cooperative. Long-term, I have some ideas in mind on how we can bolster our operation, keep VALORANT secure. I'll update you soon. Ci kanam."

